{"id":"d782096c679079e3","group":"92","path":"92/92-df-true-arithmetic.md","title":"True Arithmetic","display":"df-true-arithmetic — True Arithmetic","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Gödel's Incompleteness Theorems","book_abbrev":"92","label":"92-df-true-arithmetic","aliases":["92-df-true-arithmetic"],"display":"df-true-arithmetic — True Arithmetic","depends_on":["[[92-df-sentence]]","[[92-df-arithmetic-truth]]"],"source":"第 X 章 pp. 114–115（PDF 131–132）；本地 G 语法","source_status":"原书标准真算术概念的本地呈现"},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Gödel's Incompleteness Theorems"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"92"},{"key":"label","html":"92-df-true-arithmetic"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>92-df-true-arithmetic</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-true-arithmetic — True Arithmetic"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"90f32e29c9d553ed\" href=\"?note=90f32e29c9d553ed\" title=\"92-df-sentence\">92-df-sentence</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"482ac6c3f68b4b5b\" href=\"?note=482ac6c3f68b4b5b\" title=\"92-df-arithmetic-truth\">92-df-arithmetic-truth</a></span></div>"},{"key":"source","html":"第 X 章 pp. 114–115（PDF 131–132）；本地 G 语法"},{"key":"source_status","html":"原书标准真算术概念的本地呈现"}],"html":"<h1 id=\"df-true-arithmetic-—-True-Arithmetic-$\\mathrm{TA}$\">df-true-arithmetic — True Arithmetic <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{TA}\">\\(\\mathrm{TA}\\)</span></h1>\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Sent}_G\">\\(\\mathrm{Sent}_G\\)</span> (sentence set, see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"90f32e29c9d553ed\" href=\"?note=90f32e29c9d553ed\" title=\"92-df-sentence\">92-df-sentence</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{ArithTrue}_G\">\\(\\mathrm{ArithTrue}_G\\)</span> (external truth predicate, see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"482ac6c3f68b4b5b\" href=\"?note=482ac6c3f68b4b5b\" title=\"92-df-arithmetic-truth\">92-df-arithmetic-truth</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{TA}_G\">\\(\\mathrm{TA}_G\\)</span> (definition-target true-arithmetic theory)</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}true\\text{-}arithmetic} \\vdash \\mathrm{TA}_G\\coloneqq\\{\\varphi\\in\\mathrm{Sent}_G\\mid\\mathrm{ArithTrue}_G(\\varphi)\\}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}true\\text{-}arithmetic} \\vdash \\mathrm{TA}_G\\coloneqq\\{\\varphi\\in\\mathrm{Sent}_G\\mid\\mathrm{ArithTrue}_G(\\varphi)\\}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>关键符号：</p>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{TA}\">\\(\\mathrm{TA}\\)</span> : 真算术（在标准模型中真的句子集）</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathbb{N} \\models \\varphi\">\\(\\mathbb{N} \\models \\varphi\\)</span> : <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\varphi\">\\(\\varphi\\)</span>在标准模型中真</li>\n<li>若<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"G\">\\(G\\)</span>对标准自然数模型可靠，则<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Th}(G)\\subseteq\\mathrm{TA}_G\">\\(\\mathrm{Th}(G)\\subseteq\\mathrm{TA}_G\\)</span></li>\n<li>若 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"G\">\\(G\\)</span> 标准可靠、有效可公理化且足够强，不完备性给出 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Th}(G)\\subsetneq\\mathrm{TA}_G\">\\(\\mathrm{Th}(G)\\subsetneq\\mathrm{TA}_G\\)</span>；普通相容性不能代替标准可靠性来保证左侧包含，因为相容系统仍可能证明标准模型中的假句</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{TA}_G\">\\(\\mathrm{TA}_G\\)</span>既不可判定也不可c.e.，并且没有<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"G\">\\(G\\)</span>-语言公式在标准模型中定义其完整句子码集；这三个结论相关但不是“不可形式化”一个短语的同义反复</li>\n<li>对相应理论构造的标准Gödel句，只有保留有效性、强度及一致性条件后，才能断言它真而不可证</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Source\">[Source]</h2>\n<p>原书说有效可公理化的真算术子系统必不完备，子系统在这里已有“定理为真”的语义限定。它不表示每个相容算术扩展的定理都真。原书固定逻辑度的真值集另见 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-5\" data-note=\"640a7b260804a3a0\" href=\"?note=640a7b260804a3a0\" title=\"92-thm-smullyan-partial-truth\">92-thm-smullyan-partial-truth</a>。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"df-true-arithmetic-—-True-Arithmetic-$\\mathrm{TA}$","text":"df-true-arithmetic — True Arithmetic $\\mathrm{TA}$","level":1},{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2},{"id":"Source","text":"[Source]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"92-df-sentence","status":"resolved","id":"90f32e29c9d553ed","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[92-df-sentence]]","embed":false},{"target":"92-df-arithmetic-truth","status":"resolved","id":"482ac6c3f68b4b5b","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[92-df-arithmetic-truth]]","embed":false},{"target":"92-df-sentence","status":"resolved","id":"90f32e29c9d553ed","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathrm{Sent}_G$ (sentence set, see [[92-df-sentence]])","embed":false},{"target":"92-df-arithmetic-truth","status":"resolved","id":"482ac6c3f68b4b5b","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathrm{ArithTrue}_G$ (external truth predicate, see [[92-df-arithmetic-truth]])","embed":false},{"target":"92-thm-smullyan-partial-truth","status":"resolved","id":"640a7b260804a3a0","anchor":"ref-5","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Source]","excerpt":"原书说有效可公理化的真算术子系统必不完备，子系统在这里已有“定理为真”的语义限定。它不表示每个相容算术扩展的定理都真。原书固定逻辑度的真值集另见 [[92-thm-smullyan-partial-truth]]。","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"\\mathrm{TA}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Sent}_G","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{ArithTrue}_G","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{TA}_G","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}true\\text{-}arithmetic} \\vdash \\mathrm{TA}_G\\coloneqq\\{\\varphi\\in\\mathrm{Sent}_G\\mid\\mathrm{ArithTrue}_G(\\varphi)\\}","display":true},{"tex":"\\mathrm{TA}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathbb{N} \\models \\varphi","display":false},{"tex":"\\varphi","display":false},{"tex":"G","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Th}(G)\\subseteq\\mathrm{TA}_G","display":false},{"tex":"G","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Th}(G)\\subsetneq\\mathrm{TA}_G","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{TA}_G","display":false},{"tex":"G","display":false}],"bytes":1904,"backlinks":[{"id":"e76decda1c13805a","anchor":"ref-4","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$\\mathrm{TA}_G$ (true arithmetic, see [[92-df-true-arithmetic]])"},{"id":"baf256d78d60c2a6","anchor":"ref-102","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[92-df-omega-rule]] → [[92-df-weak-g-system]] → [[92-thm-omega-rule-true-arithmetic]] → [[92-df-true-arithmetic]]。"},{"id":"ea730faf0a9f37d4","anchor":"ref-6","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$\\mathrm{TA}_G$ (true arithmetic, see [[92-df-true-arithmetic]])"},{"id":"f2940633bae35b52","anchor":"ref-5","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$\\mathrm{TA}_G$ (true arithmetic, see [[92-df-true-arithmetic]])"},{"id":"c385ef3125110e6f","anchor":"ref-2","locations":["元数据 · depends_on"],"count":1,"excerpt":""},{"id":"823a52c75bbad9bd","anchor":"ref-203","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[92-df-true-arithmetic]]"}],"outgoing":["90f32e29c9d553ed","482ac6c3f68b4b5b","640a7b260804a3a0"]}